  "primary": "A zone at the aim point with a 5.65-block radius for 21 s. Every second, on everyone inside, including you (damage and control only hit enemies):\n• Damage 2.25 ❤ earth + 2 ❤ fire (fire ×0.5 on wet, earth ×2 on frozen)\n• Soaked for 12 s\n• Light push\n• Cold 72: extinguishes and slows, freezes for 4 s at 100 built-up cold (×2.5 on wet); puddles freeze\n• Knockback\n• Heals 1.75 ❤\n• Regeneration: +0.5 ❤ every 2 s for 9 s\n• Growth: up to 5 nearby blocks — crops +2 stages, dirt turns to grass, roots grow upward\n• Rooted in place for 3 s\n• Rooted in place for 4.5 s\n• Stone skin (Resistance I) for 6 s\n• Heat: sets on fire for 13.5 s (wet targets just dry off), thaws; melts ice and burns roots",
